# squad-lead: the closed list of states of the machine "Squad Lead home".
# value<TAB>mark (initial, final or -)<TAB>kind (active, waiting, rest, final)<TAB>meaning
provisioned	initial	waiting	the home exists and its session has not answered yet
idle	-	rest	the home is up and has no work
working	-	active	the home has open tickets of its own
down	-	waiting	the home's session does not answer
parked	-	rest	the home is set aside by Main
retired	final	final	the home is gone
